[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_prk.defend_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Eliminate the defending hostiles, and capture the inhabited locality marked on the map.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_prk.defend_usa.Mission.Description]
Your combat team is charged with escorting our forces across the river. Capture the bridge and destroy the enemy's defenses in the inhabited locality, which are preventing our troops from advancing.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_prk.defend_usa.Mission.Success]
Mission accomplished.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_prk.defend_usa.Mission.Failed]
Mission failed.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_prk.assault_usa.Mission.Description]
Your combat team is charged with escorting our forces across the river. Capture the bridge and destroy the enemy's defenses in the inhabited locality, which are preventing our troops from advancing. According to reconnaissance, the enemy will actively counterattack with mobile firepower.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_prk.assault_usa.Mission.Objectives]
